    "description": "Gorgeous and perfectly maintained Victorian duplex just one block off the Divisadero corridor! Bright, Sunny and sweet Victorian details with crown molding, pocket doors, gorgeous wood floors, decorative fireplaces and more. Private decks from each kitchen overlooking the lush and deep backyard. The Lower Owner's unit will be delivered vacant, and the market rate upper tenant's unit provides a healthy income! Each unit features 2 or 3 bedrooms (depending on use of front room) Upper unit has small office / den. Eat-in kitchens open to private decks overlooking a huge, deep shared backyard with lush foliage. Shared tandem parking, a ginormous garage with laundry. Pride of ownership throughout this beautifully maintained building. Centrally located, just steps from the hot Divisadero Corridor (yum! Brenda's Meat & Three!), and Jane the Bakery, the Fillmore, Japantown, Lower Pac Heights, Muni, Bike routes, and walking distance to Trader Joe's. Don't Miss!  1933 Ellis (lower) apprx 1263sf. 1935 Ellis (upper) apprx  1346sf per graphic artist. Also avail available as separate Tenancy in Common (TIC)s, ask agent for pricing."
  },
